{"id":"vod_hh_115532","vodId":"115532","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"机动战士高达SEED HD重制","name_cn":"机动战士高达SEED HD重制","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第48集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/69f48bca8f3133d409c715341f56491a.jpg"},"summary":"為迎接機動戰士鋼彈SEED十周年的2012年，官方於2011年8月26日啟動「HD Remaster Project（高畫質再製企劃）」，畫面尺寸比將從原先的4：3升級為16：9寬螢幕，線性PCM音源化，部分音樂採用混音版，局部畫面的替換和修正，各特效與背景的處理變更，並整合特別版三部作以及「DESTINY」的賽璐珞片，再編輯為全48話，收錄至Blu-ray共四卷BOX販售。相較於過去其他鋼彈作品的Remaster僅是單純的高畫質化，本作有著更全面的提升。「機動戰士鋼彈SEED HD」於2011年12月2","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-12-12 16:18:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":48,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e5ynYoxe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e7384BAe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bYEpgRKb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/av2qVzma/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bkRQE0xa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/azpPZoYd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dPNm48wa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dR6Y90qd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e31RWXQb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e1w1RnRb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/egJYzNYd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bmZRJVrd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bYEpgD0b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/azpPZwrd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bo2RLkja/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/av2qV7Xa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e5ynYgBe/index.m3u8"